	<item>
		<title>Russo-Ukrainian war, day 1308: Former Florida police officer operates 200 Kremlin propaganda sites</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/24/russo-ukrainian-war-day-1308-former-florida-police-officer-operates-200-kremlin-propaganda-sites/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Euromaidan Press Staff]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 21:06:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Daily review]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=361868</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Meanwhile, Ukraine launched its most extensive drone assault on Moscow Oblast, with Russian officials claiming to intercept 44 drones overnight while attacks continued into daylight hours.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="700" height="393" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Russo-Ukrainian-war-daily-review-11.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Russo-Ukrainian-war-daily-review-11.jpg 700w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Russo-Ukrainian-war-daily-review-11-300x168.jpg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Russo-Ukrainian-war-daily-review-11-380x213.jpg 380w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>
<p>        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script></p>
<h3 id="exclusive">Exclusive</h3>
<figure class="table">
<table border="0">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/performance-marketing-explained/" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Performance-marketing-explained-300x210.webp"></a></td>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/performance-marketing-explained/" rel="noopener"><strong>Performance marketing explained</strong></a>. Performance marketing shifts the focus from potential reach to tangible outcomes, ensuring accountability and maximizing return on investment (ROI)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure class="table">
<table border="0">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/thymalin-peptide-research-potential-across-biological-systems/" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Thymalin-Peptide_-Research-Potential-Across-Biological-Systems_-380x514.webp"></a></td>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/thymalin-peptide-research-potential-across-biological-systems/" rel="noopener"><strong>Thymalin peptide: Research potential across biological systems</strong></a>. This article examines the properties of Thymalin, its hypothesized mechanisms of action, and the diverse areas of research it may support, spanning from immunology to gerontology and regenerative science</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure class="table">
<table border="0">
