<table border="0">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/moldova-elections-russias-spy-agency-pushes-conspiracy-of-nato-occupation/" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_7593-300x169.jpeg"></a></td>
<td><a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/moldova-elections-russias-spy-agency-pushes-conspiracy-of-nato-occupation/" rel="noopener"><strong>Moldova elections: Russia’s spy agency pushes conspiracy of planned NATO “occupation”</strong></a>. Kremlin intelligence targets Moldova’s elections with claims of anti-Western plots.</td>
</tr>
