		<item>
		<title>Copenhagen&#8217;s main airport halts flights due to drones, but Kremlin dismisses it as &#8220;unworthy of attention&#8221;</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/copenhagens-main-airport-halts-flights-oslo-sounds-alarms-due-to-drones-but-kremlin-dismisses-it-all-as-unworthy-of-attention/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Olena Mukhina]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 16:51:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Latest news Ukraine]]></category>
