                        <h3 id="a-russian-radar-destroyed-a-pantsir-disabled-and-a-barracks-shattered-21-september-strike-confirmed-in-occupied-crimea">A Russian radar destroyed, a Pantsir disabled, and a barracks shattered — 21 September strike confirmed in occupied Crimea</h3>
                      </a>
