    </div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-correct"><strong>You got it!</strong> The article mentions a significant estimated cost of €2.5 billion for the project proposed by Poland and the Baltic states.</div>
    <div class="feedback feedback-incorrect"><strong>Oops!</strong> The figure mentioned is a substantial €2.5 billion.</div>
