                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/19/russian-crypto-banks-and-oil-trade-hit-in-eus-proposed-19th-sanctions-package/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="russian-crypto-banks-and-oil-trade-hit-in-eus-proposed-19th-sanctions-package">Russian crypto, banks, and oil trade hit in EU’s proposed 19th sanctions package</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/18/australia-slashes-russian-oil-price-cap-21-while-sanctioning-95-shadow-fleet-tankers/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="australia-slashes-russian-oil-price-cap-21-while-sanctioning-95-shadow-fleet-tankers">Australia slashes Russian oil price cap 21% while sanctioning 95 shadow fleet tankers</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    

    
