		<enclosure url="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/6dswjd-c16x9x50px42p-rc-e2017d6bdb3ebb40b40d755cdb21826d-1024x576.webp" length="13402" type="image/webp" />	</item>
		<item>
		<title>Lithuanian military granted new powers against drones — law revised after border airspace intrusions</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/lithuanian-military-granted-new-powers-against-drones-law-revised-after-border-airspace-intrusions/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Yuri Zoria]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 12:24:11 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Latest news Ukraine]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[airspace violation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[drone incursion]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[drone incursions]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Estonian airspace]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Gerbera]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Gerbera drones]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Lithuania]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Lithuanian military]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NATO]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NATO member states]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Polish airspace]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Romanian airspace]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Russian airspace violations]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Russian drone incursion]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Russian threat]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=361683</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The Aviation Law and statute on military force were changed to reflect evolving aerial threats from Russia.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-1024x576.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="lithuanian military granted new powers against drones — law revised after border airspace intrusions wreckage russian gerbera drone lithuania photographed 1 2025 armed forces militarnyi crashed public broadcaster lrt reports" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-300x169.jpg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-380x214.jpg 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-800x450.jpg 800w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania-1160x653.jpg 1160w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/crashed-russian-gerbera-lithuania.jpg 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>        
        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script>
    <p>Lithuanian public broadcaster LRT reports that Lithuania has passed urgent legislation expanding the military’s powers to counter drone threats following recent Russian airspace intrusions into several NATO countries. The legal changes are meant to address growing concerns about hostile drone activity near national borders.</p>
<div class="pk-content-block pk-block-bg pk-block-bg-light">The legal amendments were motivated by Russian provocations this past summer and over the current month. Two Russian Gerbera drones entered Lithuanian territory, one reportedly carrying explosives. In recent weeks, Russian aircraft and drones have also violated the airspace of NATO member states Poland, Estonia, and Romania.</div>
<h3 id="lithuanian-parliament-approves-rapid-drone-response-law" data-start="501" data-end="560">Lithuanian parliament approves rapid drone response law</h3>
<p data-start="562" data-end="850">On 23 September 2025, Lithuania’s parliament, the Seimas, adopted amendments to both the Aviation Law and the Statute on the Use of Military Force, LRT <a href="https://www.lrt.lt/naujienos/lietuvoje/2/2689364/lietuvos-kariuomene-gales-greiciau-ir-paprasciau-numusti-gresme-keliancius-dronus">says</a>. <strong>The changes grant the military expanded authority to neutralize drones that threaten the country’s airspace, especially in restricted zones</strong>.</p><div data-fuse="incontent_1"></div>
<p data-start="852" data-end="1044">The amendments were approved under emergency procedure, which, under Seimas rules, is used to safeguard “<em>vital public and state interests</em>.” All lawmakers present in the chamber voted in favor.</p>


  <div class="explore-further">
    <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/pal-jonson-sweden-prepared-to-act-if-airspace-is-breached-military-response-remains-an-option/"></a>

                        
      <div class="explore-further__img">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="180" height="120" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister.jpg" class="explore-further__img" alt="another warning russia sweden just joined poland uk saying “we shoot down” skies swedish defense minister pål jonson facebook/ruetem umierov pal johson confirmed forces can use armed force even without" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister.jpg 1600w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-300x200.jpg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-1536x1023.jpg 1536w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-380x253.jpg 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-800x533.jpg 800w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pal-johson-swedish-defense-minister-1160x773.jpg 1160w" sizes="(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px">      </div>
    
    <div class="explore-further__body">
              <div class="explore-further__cat">Explore further</div>
            
                            
        <h4 id="pal-jonson-sweden-prepared-to-act-if-airspace-is-breached-military-response-remains-an-option" class="explore-further__title">Pål Jonson: Sweden prepared to act if airspace is breached — military response remains an option</h4>
          </div>
  </div>



<p data-start="1046" data-end="1399">The country’s Defense Minister Dovilė Šakalienė said the previous laws and procedures were not designed to meet the challenges of current drone-related threats. She explained that the updated statute establishes a new legal basis for using military force against unmanned aerial vehicles in restricted zones when flights violate the rules set by the military command.</p>
<div class="pk-content-block pk-block-bg pk-block-bg-light" data-start="1401" data-end="1640">Under the new law, the military—on orders from the defense minister or a delegated official—can use force against drones in prohibited or restricted zones when those drones breach operational restrictions, flight conditions, or procedures.</div>


  <div class="explore-further">
    <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/21/russian-warplanes-fly-into-nato-airspace-czech-president-says-maybe-its-time-to-shoot-them-down/"></a>

                        
      <div class="explore-further__img">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="180" height="116" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel.jpg" class="explore-further__img" alt="russian warplanes fly nato airspace — czech president says maybe it’s time shoot down petr pavel warns allowing intrusions like recent mig-31 fighter jet flyovers only invites more ukraine news" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel.jpg 1274w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel-300x193.jpg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel-1024x658.jpg 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel-380x244.jpg 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel-800x514.jpg 800w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/petr-pavel-1160x746.jpg 1160w" sizes="(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px">      </div>
    
    <div class="explore-further__body">
              <div class="explore-further__cat">Explore further</div>
            
                            
        <h4 id="russian-warplanes-fly-into-nato-airspace-czech-president-says-maybe-its-time-to-shoot-them-down" class="explore-further__title">Russian warplanes fly into NATO airspace — Czech President says maybe it’s time to shoot them down</h4>
          </div>
  </div><div data-fuse="incontent_2"></div>



<h3 id="military-force-now-allowed-in-more-drone-related-cases" data-start="1642" data-end="1700">Military force now allowed in more drone-related cases</h3>
<p data-start="1702" data-end="1910"><strong>Before the law change, troops could only engage drones used as weapons in prohibited zones</strong>. The Defense Ministry said the new regulations would allow more flexible and effective responses to drone incursions. However, it emphasized that force would only be used in cases of <em>“absolute military necessity</em>” and with all available precautions to avoid harm to people or property.</p>
<p data-start="2080" data-end="2404">Additionally, the amendments to the Aviation Law introduce a mechanism for activating restricted zones and informing aircraft in response to airspace violations. The military commander or their delegate now has the power to request immediate activation or deactivation of restricted areas from air traffic service providers.</p>

          <div class="read-also">
          <div class="read-also__inner">
