                        <h3 id="drone-activity-halts-flights-in-denmark-and-norway-airports-in-copenhagen-and-oslo-were-temporarily-closed">Drone activity halts flights in Denmark and Norway — airports in Copenhagen and Oslo were temporarily closed</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/19/russian-warplanes-violated-estonias-airspace-tallinn/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="russian-warplanes-violated-nato-member-estonias-airspace-tallinn">Russian warplanes violated NATO member Estonia’s airspace – Tallinn</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/18/russian-gerbera-drone-wreckage-washes-onto-latvian-beach-after-drifting-from-sea/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="russian-gerbera-drone-wreckage-washes-onto-latvian-beach-after-drifting-from-sea">Russian Gerbera drone wreckage washes onto Latvian beach after drifting from sea</h3>
