                        <h3 id="ukraine-scales-up-drone-strikes-on-russian-oil-infrastructure-zelenskyy-says">Ukraine scales up drone strikes on Russian oil infrastructure, Zelenskyy says</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/18/1300-km-deep-into-russia-ukraines-drone-hits-gazproms-salavat-refinery-setting-it-ablaze-video/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="1300-km-deep-into-russia-ukraines-drone-hits-gazproms-salavat-refinery-setting-it-ablaze-video">1,300 km deep into Russia, Ukraine’s drone hits Gazprom’s Salavat refinery, setting it ablaze (video)</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
