		<enclosure url="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/e13676dd-0f59-4ec6-9008-809f5761651d-1024x768.jpg" length="127287" type="image/jpeg" />	</item>
		<item>
		<title>From Baltic to Black Sea: EU plans a &#8220;drone wall&#8221; across NATO’s eastern edge</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/europe-mobilize-drone-wall-against-russian-uav-incursions-across-natos-eastern-flank/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Taisiia Vivdych]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 11:36:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Latest news Ukraine]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[European Union]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[military cooperation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NATO]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ukraine]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ursula von der Leyen]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=361640</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[On 26 September, seven EU countries and Ukraine are going to discuss the so-called "drone wall" to protect Europe's eastern frontier, following Russia's unprecedented violation of Estonian, Polish, and Romanian airspace.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1024" height="682" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_8892.jpeg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="A contractor waits to deploy a drone during the Iron Defender 25 military exercise on Sept. 18, 2025, in Nowa Deba, Poland. Source: Omar Marques/Getty Images" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_8892.jpeg 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_8892-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_8892-380x253.jpeg 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/IMG_8892-800x533.jpeg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>        
        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script>
    
<p>According to <a href="https://www.politico.eu/article/estonia-ukraine-meet-drone-wall-proposal-airspace-russia-warplanes/">Politico</a>, the EU’s “drone wall” envisions an integrated network of modern radars, sensors, and coordinated air defense systems stretching over 2,000 kilometers from Finland’s Arctic border to Romania’s Black Sea coast. This air defense line would provide real-time monitoring and rapid response capabilities against Russian aircraft and drone threats along NATO’s most vulnerable eastern borders.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p><em>The decision to accelerate consultations comes as a direct response to numerous incidents in recent weeks: Russian drones crossed into Polish and Romanian airspace earlier this month, while on 19 September, three Russian military jets made an unprecedented violation of Estonia’s border.</em></p>
</blockquote><div data-fuse="incontent_1"></div>



<p>The online gathering will include seven NATO eastern flank countries — Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania, Finland, Poland, Romania, and Bulgaria — alongside Ukraine and European Commissioner for Defense and Space Andrius Kubilius</p>



<p>European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen plans to present financing mechanisms for the project during an informal EU leaders’ meeting in Copenhagen on 1 October. According to European diplomats, the discussions include creating a dedicated budget line for defense technologies, potentially amounting to hundreds of millions of euros.</p>



<p></p>


          <div class="read-also">
          <div class="read-also__inner">
                          <h2 id="read-also" class="read-also__headline">
                Read also              </h2>
                        
            <ul class="read-also__list">
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/russia-claims-44-drones-shot-down-near-moscow-in-one-night-and-the-attack-isnt-over-yet/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="russia-claims-44-drones-shot-down-near-moscow-in-one-night-and-the-attack-isnt-over-yet">Russia claims 44 drones shot down near Moscow in one night — and the attack isn’t over yet</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/latvia-wants-to-restore-marshes-on-border-with-russia-to-strengthen-defense/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="latvia-wants-to-restore-marshes-on-border-with-russia-to-strengthen-defense">Latvia wants to restore marshes on border with Russia to strengthen defense</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/09/23/isw-putin-pressures-trump-administration-on-arms-control-to-facilitate-us-russian-rapprochement/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="isw-putin-pressures-trump-administration-on-arms-control-to-facilitate-us-russian-rapprochement">ISW: Putin pressures Trump administration on arms control to facilitate US-Russian rapprochement</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    


<p></p>

